00:16:01,410 --> 00:16:03,200
我真是忍不住要怀疑
You know, I find myself wondering

370
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:05,710
你以前是不是一直在骗我
if anything you've ever told me is true.

371
00:16:06,290 --> 00:16:07,350
我还是没能挽回局面
I didn't make it back.

372
00:16:07,350 --> 00:16:09,560
事态严重  我是在劫难逃了
The ship sank, I'm in hell.

373
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:16,200
你说自己来自新泽西  我可不敢相信你
You say you're from New Jersey, but how can I believe you?

374
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,460
世界上怎么会有人冒充
Why would anyone claim to be from New Jersey

375
00:16:18,460 --> 00:16:19,750
自己是新泽西人呢
if they weren't?

376
00:16:22,330 --> 00:16:24,370
好吧  你说得有道理
All right, I'll give you that one.

377
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:27,700
我都道过歉了
Hey, I said I was sorry.

378
00:16:27,700 --> 00:16:29,330
你还想要我怎么样啊
What else do you want from me?

379
00:16:29,330 --> 00:16:31,510
