- I want you to admit that what you did was wrong. - Fine.

380
00:16:32,030 --> 00:16:34,130
我真的错了
What I did was wrong.

381
00:16:34,130 --> 00:16:36,230
信你才怪
I wish I could believe you.

382
00:16:37,990 --> 00:16:38,600
算了吧
You know what?

383
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:39,870
我不载你去上班了
I'm not driving you to work,

384
00:16:39,870 --> 00:16:41,510
你实在是烦死人
