你这人心口不一
You say one thing and do the other,

386
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:47,830
所以你不但要载我上班  还挺喜欢我的
so then you are driving me and you find me a delight.

387
00:16:48,890 --> 00:16:50,290
-别说了  -继续吗
