388
00:16:50,290 --> 00:16:52,950
-再见  -你好
- Bye! - Hello!

389
00:16:57,060 --> 00:17:01,080
你其实是想竖其他四根指头对吧
So I guess you're really holding up the other four fingers?

390
00:17:04,140 --> 00:17:05,640
你这么早过来干什么
Oh, hey, what are you doing here so early?

391
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:06,770
送谢尔顿上班
Driving Sheldon to work.

392
00:17:07,230 --> 00:17:08,860
他还在生莱纳德的气吗
He's still mad at Leonard, huh?

393
00:17:08,870 --> 00:17:10,230
他也在生你的气
Well, he's mad at you, too.

394
00:17:10,230 --> 00:17:14,160
他说你是让他朋友堕落的魅魔
He says you're the succubus who led his friend astray.

395
00:17:10,230 --> 00:17:14,160
在男子睡觉的时候降临并与之交媾的女妖

396
00:17:15,450 --> 00:17:18,690
我不知道魅魔是什么  不过
I don't know what "Succubus" is, but...

397
00:17:18,690 --> 00:17:21,650
里面有魔[烂]字  肯定不是好词
it has "suck" in it, so that can't be good.

398
00:17:23,190 --> 00:17:24,440
我就觉得听到你的声音了
Thought I heard you out here.

399
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:25,700
你好呀  谢尔顿
Hey, Sheldon.

400
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:27,160
你不配我说"你好"
You don't get a "hey."

401
00:17:27,160 --> 00:17:29,060
你只配得到"嗯"
You get a "hmm."

402
00:17:29,070 --> 00:17:30,600
拜托  不要这么绝情
Come on, don't be like that.

403
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:32,940
我们前几个月不是一直玩得挺好的嘛
We had so much fun together the last couple of months.

404
00:17:32,940 --> 00:17:33,930
你说得对
You're right.

405
00:17:33,930 --> 00:17:36,220
所以你的背叛才显得更加不可饶恕
Which makes your betrayal all the more devastating.

406
00:17:36,220 --> 00:17:36,810
谢尔顿
Sheldon...

407
00:17:36,810 --> 00:17:39,160
我都把自己的超市会员卡
I let you buy feminine hygiene products

408
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:41,640
借给你去买女性生理用品了
with my supermarket club card.

409
00:17:42,420 --> 00:17:43,960
你知道现在他们都寄给我
You have any idea the kind of coupons

410
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:46,070
什么产品的折扣券吗
I'm going to get in the mail now?

411
00:17:47,100 --> 00:17:48,810
谢尔顿  你是和莱纳德斗气
Sheldon, your fight's with Leonard.

412
00:17:48,810 --> 00:17:49,780
佩妮和这事没有关...
Penny's got nothing to do...

413
00:17:49,780 --> 00:17:51,830
你也要小心了  艾米
Careful, Amy.

414
00:17:51,830 --> 00:17:56,010
我的敌人的女友的朋友  也是我的敌人哦
The friend of my enemy's girlfriend is my enemy.

415
00:17:56,010 --> 00:17:57,220
-真的吗  -是的
- Really? - Yes.

416
00:17:57,220 --> 00:17:59,750
你要不就顺着我  要不就逆着我
You're either with me or against me.

417
00:17:59,750 --> 00:18:01,860
我看你是打算坐公车上班了
You want to take the bus to work?

418
00:18:03,520 --> 00:18:05,080
也许还存在第三种选择
Maybe there's a third option.

419
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:10,720
对了  我早餐吃的就是甜甜圈  混球
FYI, I had a doughnut for breakfast, you jerk.

420
00:18:13,780 --> 00:18:15,070
现在我们还在等
So now we're just waiting for the data

421
00:18:15,070 --> 00:18:16,560
船上的资料处理完毕
from the ship to be crunched,

422
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:19,090
但从数据上看  结果应该不差
but the numbers look pretty promising.

423
00:18:19,090 --> 00:18:20,140
太厉害了
That's so great.

424
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:23,060
如果你们能证明盎鲁效应的存在
If you guys prove the existence of Unruh radiation...

425
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:23,810
喂  喂  这位仁兄
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

426
00:18:23,810 --> 00:18:25,380
看我的眼  别乱看
My eyes are up here.

427
00:18:27,590 --> 00:18:29,150
霍华德  拉杰
Howard, Raj.

428
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:30,960
犹大[背叛者]
Judas.

429
00:18:31,610 --> 00:18:32,780
懒得理你
You know what?

430
00:18:32,780 --> 00:18:34,410
你就是个疯子
You're a crazy person.

431
00:18:34,410 --> 00:18:36,570
一个拥有好记性的疯子
A crazy person with a long memory,

432
00:18:36,570 --> 00:18:39,770
如果一切进行顺利  还有一支机器人军团
and if all goes according to plan, a robot army.

433
00:18:40,970 --> 00:18:41,550
别说了
Stop it.

434
00:18:41,550 --> 00:18:42,920
或者是变异军团
Or a mutant army.

435
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:45,290
就看我写在圆梦网上的计划有没有人投资了
It depends on how my Kickstarter goes.

436
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:49,410
我说你们别闹了
I said, stop it!

437
00:18:49,410 --> 00:18:51,750
听我说
Now, listen to me.

438
00:18:51,750 --> 00:18:55,030
你们俩不光是普通朋友
You two aren't just friends.

439
00:18:55,030 --> 00:18:57,710
你们可是好朋友
You're best friends.

440
00:18:57,710 --> 00:19:00,100
友情是多么美好的事啊
And that's a beautiful thing.

441
00:19:01,940 --> 00:19:05,740
莱纳德  你知道他为什么特别生气吗
I mean, Leonard, you know why he's so mad at you?

442
00:19:05,740 --> 00:19:08,260
那是因为他想念你呀
It's 'cause he missed you!

443
00:19:08,260 --> 00:19:09,460
而你作为他的好友
Yeah, and as his friend,

444
00:19:09,460 --> 00:19:11,600
你应该高兴才对
you should be happy

445
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:15,100
他找到了生命中的真爱
he has love in his life.

446
00:19:15,100 --> 00:19:17,050
就像我一样
As I do.

447
00:19:18,980 --> 00:19:21,390
这位帅哥那天摸了我的胸部
This man held my breast the other day,

448
00:19:21,390 --> 00:19:23,210
我为此深深敬爱他
and I love him for it.

449
00:19:25,050 --> 00:19:27,280
你不如再吼大声点  老兄
A little loud, dude.

450
00:19:29,290 --> 00:19:33,220
所以  我们能不能忽略这些小矛盾
So, can we please put aside these petty differences

451
00:19:33,230 --> 00:19:36,430
为了我们的团聚开心一点
and just be glad we're here together?

452
00:19:39,300 --> 00:19:41,000
-好吧  -我同意
- Okay. - I suppose so.

453
00:19:41,420 --> 00:19:42,940
谢谢
Thank you.

454
00:19:44,350 --> 00:19:45,230
我们没做什么怪事
Uh, it wasn't anything weird.

455
00:19:45,230 --> 00:19:47,960
我是为了测量他的胸部有多大而已
It was just to see how big they were.

456
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:55,920
后来莱纳德带我去了理发店和牙医诊所
And then Leonard took me to the barber and the dentist,

457
