459
00:20:02,200 --> 00:20:04,750
我原以为尺寸测量最受欢迎
I thought the measures were going to be the stars of the show;

460
00:20:04,750 --> 00:20:07,540
没想到重量测量更胜一筹
 turns out it was the weights.

461
00:20:08,580 --> 00:20:10,760
你们和好了  我真开心
I'm so glad you guys are friends again.

462
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:13,550
我俩和好了   我也很开心
And I'm glad you and I are friends again, too.

463
00:20:13,550 --> 00:20:15,060
我想起来了
Aw. Which reminds me.

464
00:20:15,060 --> 00:20:18,020
这是随信寄来的  我想送给你
This came in the mail, and I want you to have it.

465
00:20:18,020 --> 00:20:20,920
女性阴部洗剂  凭券折价5毛
"50 cents off Vagisil."

466
00:20:23,060 --> 00:20:25,350
使用的时候可别忘了我
Think of me when you apply it.

467
00:20:27,970 --> 00:20:29,580
我想对你们说
Uh, can I just say,

468
00:20:29,580 --> 00:20:31,610
我真心怀念大家伙聚在一起的时光
I've missed all of us hanging out together.

469
00:20:31,610 --> 00:20:33,120
-没错  -我也是
- Yeah. - Me, too.

470
00:20:33,120 --> 00:20:35,800
库斯拉帕从什么时候开始
Um, since when can Koothrappali talk

471
00:20:35,800 --> 00:20:37,680
不用喝酒也可以在女生面前讲话啦
in front of the girls without a beer?

472
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:39,670
你刚走他就痊愈了
Oh, that happened right after you left.

473
00:20:39,670 --> 00:20:41,630
怎么没人告诉我
And no one told me?

474
00:20:41,630 --> 00:20:44,740
我们居然忘记告诉他了
Can't believe we forgot to tell him.

475
00:20:47,280 --> 00:20:50,040
使用的时候别忘了谢尔顿
Think of Sheldon when you apply it.

